'''Total War: Spring Special''' (大乱闘 春イベスペシャル, ''Dai Rantō Haru Ibesupesharu'', '''Great Free-for-All: Spring Eve Special''') is the Spring [[Total Wars|Total War]]. It is unlocked after clearing [[Bears be Bare (Monthly Event)|Bears be Bare]], [[Teacher! It's Spring! (Monthly Event)|Teacher! It's Spring!]] and [[Love is Sickness (Monthly Event)|Love is Sickness]], and contains enemies from all three events. It was added in [[Version 9.7 Update|Version 9.7]].

